     * belongs to the platform console, not a company's sidebar. The old GL
     * event mapping (still posted to by the retired Procurement and stock-count
     * code) and the old Settings calendar gave way to Access Control → Ledger
     * Integration and HR & Payroll's shift and holiday screens (2026-11-15).
